# The two capacitive keys under the screen, reported by the Atmel touch controller
# itself (KEY_BACK and KEY_MENU in getevent).
#
# KEY_MENU is the square key, and it is recent apps, not a menu: APP_SWITCH, as in
# the stock file. The stock file also maps ASUS' gesture keycodes (183-189) to labels
# like GESTURE_W that exist only in ASUS' framework; Pie's parser rejects a whole
# file over one unknown label, so they are left out.

key 158   BACK
key 139   APP_SWITCH
